---
title: Buy three, on a moving bus
order: 6
summary: Small targets, crowded together, with a destructive button next door. Then measured against the standard.
scenario: You are on the top deck of a bus with one hand on the rail. Or you have a tremor, or arthritis in your thumb, or you are holding a sleeping toddler. You have two stops left to order the thing you forgot.
tasks:
  - Close the cookie banner, change the quantity to 3, and pay. Use one finger or the hand you do not normally use.
  - Watch the mis-tap counter as you go. Do not try to be careful &mdash; be as quick as you would really be.
  - Press <em>Measure the targets</em> and compare the numbers against 24 and 44 pixels.
time: 8 minutes
barrier: Targets too small and too close together
criterion: WCAG 2.2 &mdash; <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/target-size-minimum.html">2.5.8 Target Size (Minimum)</a> at AA, 44 by 44 at AAA
script: targets.js
